[
  {
    "id": 6901001090010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』優勝、本当におめでとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00023",
    "bgm": "020",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6901001090010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "私も会場で見てたんですけど、\r\n発表の瞬間、思わず大声を出しちゃいましたよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6901001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "今もまだ興奮しちゃってて、\r\n今日はもう眠れそうにありません！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6901001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、はづきさん！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "本当によくやった\r\n期待以上の結果を出してくれたな",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6902001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "社長も……ありがとうございます！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ふふ。私と社長も会場に来てましたけど、\r\nすごかったですよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6901001090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "優勝したってわかった瞬間、社長が泣いてしまって……\r\nステージをほとんど見れていませんでしたから",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6901001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "こ、こら！\r\n彼の前でそういうことを言うな！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6902001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "それだけ優勝したのを\r\n喜んでたってことじゃないですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6901001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "そ、それはそうだが……",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6902001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "社長、本当にありがとうございます！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……とにかく。もっと礼を言うべき相手、\r\nいや、祝うべき相手がいるんじゃないか",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6902001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうですね\r\n今日の主役は、他でもない彼女ですから",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "なら、私たちのことは気にせず\r\n早く行ってこい",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6902001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "彼女のこと、いっぱい\r\n褒めてあげてくださいねー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6901001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい！　もちろんです！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華、そこにいたのか\r\n…………何やってるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いや、それが大変なんだよプロデューサー！\r\nいくらほっぺをつねっても、夢から覚めなくってさー",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "早いとこ覚めないと……こんないい夢見てたら\r\n起きた時にショックで大変なことになるってば……！",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど。それで、どんな夢を？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "決まってるでしょ！　『W.I.N.G.』優勝だよ！\r\nこんなの夢じゃなきゃありえないって！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あ、もしかして三峰のほっぺだけじゃ足りないのかも！\r\nプロデューサーのほっぺ、つねってみてもいい？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "待て待て！\r\n夢じゃないから、安心してくれ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それって本当？　本当に本当？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当だ！　ちゃんと現実だから！\r\nほら、手をおろせって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……そっか～。夢じゃないんだね\r\n現実、なんだぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なんかこういうの、懐かしいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "懐かしい？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、アイドルになったばかりの頃も\r\nよくドッキリとか夢じゃないかとか言ってただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あー、そうだったかもね",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はもう大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "当然。ご心配には及びませんよ～\r\n……いろんな人に、いっぱい応援してもらったしさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090090"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ファンのみんな、お仕事で関わった人……\r\nもちろん、プロデューサーからも",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "みんなが声をかけてくれたから、\r\nちゃんと自信を持てるようになったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……いつか、三峰が思う理想のアイドルになるよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今はまだ全然だけどね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……結華にとっての、理想のアイドルってなんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "憧れられるのに、相応しいアイドル、かな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "前までは、見て憧れる側にいたから\r\nアイドルって別世界の人だと思ってたんだよ",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090150"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だから、自分とは違うんだって\r\n思い込んじゃってたんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090160"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今は三峰も、昔自分が見てた場所に、\r\nアイドルとして立ってるんだなって思えるようになったから",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090170"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だから、誰からも憧れられるような……\r\nそんなアイドルになりたいって思うんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そっか……良い目標だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……って、うわ。語っちゃったよ、恥ずかしー……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えーっと……Ｐたん、今のは忘れて！\r\nほらほら早く！　忘れて忘れて！",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……残念だけど、結華が言ったことは忘れられないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華が教えてくれたことを、絶対に忘れたりしない\r\nだからその夢、絶対に叶えような",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは……\r\nほんとにもう、真面目というかなんというかー……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090210"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "けどまぁ……しょうがないか\r\n聞かれちゃったからには責任取ってもらわないとね",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090220"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そんなわけで、プロデューサーには\r\n今後も三峰をプロデュースさせたげよう！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはありがたいな。これからもよろしく頼むよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001090240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うん。三峰が理想のアイドルになれるまで……\r\n今後ともよろしくねっ、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700109/6007001090240"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]